 3rd  his family suspects foul play but an  independent autopsy reiterated the  coroner's initial findings  that his death was consistent with  drowning however the iberia parish  sheriff's office  is investigating his disappearance as a  possible homicide  for cbs this morning jerica duncan new  york  so many questions still in that case

